  "body": "Hi everyone! I'm not very experienced in opening Issues on github so I apologize if something's not the way I'm supposed to write it.\r\n\r\nI'm working with Synapse (and Element in the Forntend) and I've noticed the only options for a database are SQLite (for development only) and PostgreSQL.\r\nI have some time of experience with SQLServer and Oracle administration, and already have an existing SQLServer locally, and would like to be able to place my database on it as well to centralize all my data.\r\n\r\nIs this something that's planned or in progress, or will Synapse stay on PostgreSQL support only for the foreseeable future?\r\n\r\nThanks!",
